# Cryptic Command's counter mode takes a noncreature spell and its return mode a noncreature permanent (CR 700.2,
# 701.6a, 400.3): Bot2's Ancestral Recall is countered and Bot2's own Mox Sapphire is returned to its hand, so Bot2
# draws nothing from the Recall (its hand is seven: eight after its draw step, one cast, one cast, one returned).
# While choosing each target, a battlefield permanent is refused for the counter mode and a stack spell is refused for
# the return mode (CR 109.2b, 110.1, 115.1a, 700.2c): the same Mox and Recall are accepted by their respective modes.

